         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `ConceptMap.group.element.noMap` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `ConceptMap.group.element.target.equivalence` as `SourceIsBroaderThanTarget`.\nThe mappings for `ConceptMap.group.element.noMap` do not cover the following types: boolean.\nThe mappings for `ConceptMap.group.element.noMap` do not cover the following types based on type expansion: value.\nIf noMap = true, then the behavior of ConceptMap.group.unmapped (if present) does not apply." ]
